  "Scenes.Doloresscene.DoloresAmbitionAnswer.LawlessClaim": "This land seems as good a place as any to stake your claim. There are no laws here, no rules to chain you down. So long as you stay here, you're free to do what you want, when you want, and anyone who would stand in your way is nothing more than an obstacle."
