  "Scenes.Doloresscene.DoloresAmbitionAnswer.RomanticVagabond": "You're a romantic at heart--and in other places. Mareth is quite a bountiful land for the amorous vagabond, and you've been very happy with sampling all of the local flavors."
  "Scenes.Doloresscene.DoloresAmbitionAnswer.VanquishScourgeAnswer": "The answer is very simple: you're here to vanquish the demonic scourge plaguing this land. You'll not rest easy until Mareth--and all of the other worlds connected to it--are safe from the threat of corruption."
